{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEARWOODS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A co-op survival horror</strong> where the forest becomes your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Step into the cursed woods. Silence lives here. And the shadow watches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will you save Aveline\u2026 or condemn her forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/9718b508fd14b85606d52c7c5091d627.poster.avif?t=1772454296\" width=800 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/9718b508fd14b85606d52c7c5091d627.webm?t=1772454296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Explore.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The forest breathes. The fog thickens.<br> Every step echoes, as if something listens.<br> Sometimes you hear whispers. Sometimes it\u2019s just the wind... or maybe not.<br> The light flickers. The ground creaks.<br> You are not alone among these trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find your path between fear and silence.<br> Every trail could be your last.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/39f1f597e1980de0b4ff3464d630e12d.poster.avif?t=1772454296\" width=800 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/39f1f597e1980de0b4ff3464d630e12d.webm?t=1772454296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Find.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Everything matters \u2013 a torn notebook, a glint of metal, a voice on the radio.<br> Search for GPS fragments, Aveline\u2019s journal, and the clues that lead deep into the cursed forest.<br> The more you discover, the less you want to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each piece of the story brings you closer to the truth.<br> Or closer to something that cannot be stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/2e6ed5cf556ebe97e4c92c39ed7ddd93.poster.avif?t=1772454296\" width=800 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/2e6ed5cf556ebe97e4c92c39ed7ddd93.webm?t=1772454296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Face it.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Silence shatters.<br> Something steps out from the dark.<br> It doesn\u2019t breathe. It doesn\u2019t blink.<br> It just watches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Light is your life.<br> But even that won\u2019t always save you.<br> Not every fight is meant to be won \u2013 sometimes survival means running.<br> Hide. Turn off your flashlight. Don\u2019t move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The demon senses fear. And it feeds on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/91c58b5b3ca8a9d6222b42f80440ceb7.poster.avif?t=1772454296\" width=800 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/91c58b5b3ca8a9d6222b42f80440ceb7.webm?t=1772454296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>See what remains.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The door opens slowly. The smell of blood, smoke, and ash.<br> Signs of struggle. Bodies.<br> A mark on the wall \u2013 the same one you\u2019ve seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You know it\u2019s the demon\u2019s work.<br> But why? Who was it looking for?<br> You keep moving forward, because there\u2019s no other choice.<br> Only answers might lead to escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/36bd3bc60080ca1e276a0dac00777727.poster.avif?t=1772454296\" width=800 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/36bd3bc60080ca1e276a0dac00777727.webm?t=1772454296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Survive together.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Three players. One night.<br> Each of you holds the light. Each of you could be the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Help each other \u2013 or watch your friends fall one by one.<br> Sometimes silence saves. Sometimes it betrays.<br> Only teamwork gives you a chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trust becomes the currency of survival.<br> But remember\u2026 something always watches from the trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/4ca356825b8a04757402366ff1d6cc31.poster.avif?t=1772454296\" width=800 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/4ca356825b8a04757402366ff1d6cc31.webm?t=1772454296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Tracks. Fear. Choices.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You see footprints that don\u2019t belong to humans.<br> You hear something moving behind you.<br> Is it the demon? Or just the echo of your fear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Together you decide \u2013 direction, light, silence.<br> Every choice has a price.<br> Not every path leads to salvation.<br> Not every silence is safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/fea89586f3029c8863c452422a642f39.poster.avif?t=1772454296\" width=800 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/fea89586f3029c8863c452422a642f39.webm?t=1772454296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Escape... if you can.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The GPS signal grows stronger.<br> The radio crackles \u2013 someone answers.<br> A helicopter awaits... or maybe it lies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your heart races. The demon is right behind you.<br> The light flickers, your scream drowns in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is the final run.<br> The final chance.<br> Don\u2019t look back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 Dark, haunting forest \u2013 silence, whispers, and fear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 3-player co-op \u2013 share the light and the panic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Aveline\u2019s story \u2013 uncover her fate and decide her salvation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 Light &amp; noise mechanics \u2013 shine wisely, or die trying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 Relentless demon \u2013 stalking, hunting, killing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Exploration &amp; survival \u2013 puzzles, traps, and the struggle for every GPS piece.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude81 Climactic escape \u2013 radio chatter, rescue signals, and a desperate sprint to freedom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\ude08 <strong>Will you dare to enter the forest?</strong> <br> The darkness waits. You decide who returns from it</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3296990?t=1772454296","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/b1a3bd8a29cc63b5d61dc76ea947d0bd734b39ed/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772454296","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/839205b42508000ac380964ca36d61fd490664d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772454296","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/839205b42508000ac380964ca36d61fd490664d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772454296","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4025550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Fearwoods \u2013 play co-op with up to 3 players \ud83c\udf32\ud83d\ude31</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/36bd3bc60080ca1e276a0dac00777727.poster.avif?t=1772454296\" width=800 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/36bd3bc60080ca1e276a0dac00777727.webm?t=1772454296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEARWOODS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A co-op survival horror</strong> where the forest becomes your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Step into the cursed woods. Silence lives here. And the shadow watches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will you save Aveline\u2026 or condemn her forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/9718b508fd14b85606d52c7c5091d627.poster.avif?t=1772454296\" width=800 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/9718b508fd14b85606d52c7c5091d627.webm?t=1772454296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Explore.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The forest breathes. The fog thickens.<br> Every step echoes, as if something listens.<br> Sometimes you hear whispers. Sometimes it\u2019s just the wind... or maybe not.<br> The light flickers. The ground creaks.<br> You are not alone among these trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find your path between fear and silence.<br> Every trail could be your last.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/39f1f597e1980de0b4ff3464d630e12d.poster.avif?t=1772454296\" width=800 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/39f1f597e1980de0b4ff3464d630e12d.webm?t=1772454296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Find.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Everything matters \u2013 a torn notebook, a glint of metal, a voice on the radio.<br> Search for GPS fragments, Aveline\u2019s journal, and the clues that lead deep into the cursed forest.<br> The more you discover, the less you want to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each piece of the story brings you closer to the truth.<br> Or closer to something that cannot be stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/2e6ed5cf556ebe97e4c92c39ed7ddd93.poster.avif?t=1772454296\" width=800 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/2e6ed5cf556ebe97e4c92c39ed7ddd93.webm?t=1772454296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Face it.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Silence shatters.<br> Something steps out from the dark.<br> It doesn\u2019t breathe. It doesn\u2019t blink.<br> It just watches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Light is your life.<br> But even that won\u2019t always save you.<br> Not every fight is meant to be won \u2013 sometimes survival means running.<br> Hide. Turn off your flashlight. Don\u2019t move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The demon senses fear. And it feeds on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/91c58b5b3ca8a9d6222b42f80440ceb7.poster.avif?t=1772454296\" width=800 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/91c58b5b3ca8a9d6222b42f80440ceb7.webm?t=1772454296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>See what remains.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The door opens slowly. The smell of blood, smoke, and ash.<br> Signs of struggle. Bodies.<br> A mark on the wall \u2013 the same one you\u2019ve seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You know it\u2019s the demon\u2019s work.<br> But why? Who was it looking for?<br> You keep moving forward, because there\u2019s no other choice.<br> Only answers might lead to escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/36bd3bc60080ca1e276a0dac00777727.poster.avif?t=1772454296\" width=800 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/36bd3bc60080ca1e276a0dac00777727.webm?t=1772454296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Survive together.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Three players. One night.<br> Each of you holds the light. Each of you could be the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Help each other \u2013 or watch your friends fall one by one.<br> Sometimes silence saves. Sometimes it betrays.<br> Only teamwork gives you a chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trust becomes the currency of survival.<br> But remember\u2026 something always watches from the trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/4ca356825b8a04757402366ff1d6cc31.poster.avif?t=1772454296\" width=800 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/4ca356825b8a04757402366ff1d6cc31.webm?t=1772454296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Tracks. Fear. Choices.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You see footprints that don\u2019t belong to humans.<br> You hear something moving behind you.<br> Is it the demon? Or just the echo of your fear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Together you decide \u2013 direction, light, silence.<br> Every choice has a price.<br> Not every path leads to salvation.<br> Not every silence is safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/fea89586f3029c8863c452422a642f39.poster.avif?t=1772454296\" width=800 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/extras/fea89586f3029c8863c452422a642f39.webm?t=1772454296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Escape... if you can.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The GPS signal grows stronger.<br> The radio crackles \u2013 someone answers.<br> A helicopter awaits... or maybe it lies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your heart races. The demon is right behind you.<br> The light flickers, your scream drowns in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is the final run.<br> The final chance.<br> Don\u2019t look back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 Dark, haunting forest \u2013 silence, whispers, and fear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 3-player co-op \u2013 share the light and the panic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Aveline\u2019s story \u2013 uncover her fate and decide her salvation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 Light &amp; noise mechanics \u2013 shine wisely, or die trying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 Relentless demon \u2013 stalking, hunting, killing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Exploration &amp; survival \u2013 puzzles, traps, and the struggle for every GPS piece.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude81 Climactic escape \u2013 radio chatter, rescue signals, and a desperate sprint to freedom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\ude08 <strong>Will you dare to enter the forest?</strong> <br> The darkness waits. You decide who returns from it</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Fearwoods"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296990/033d2318038b57041d30b92375295da032d8a4bf/header.jpg?t=1772454296","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements